-Understanding-Protecting/dp/0520267125/?tag=ththve-20">The Fourth Trimester: Understanding, Protecting, and Nurturing and Infant through the First Three Months</a></em>. (Berkeley: University of California Press, 2013). <a href="#return-note-4241-7">&#8617;</a></li></ol></div><div style="clear:both;"></div>

