    <div id="author-bio">
        <h4>Written by <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160916225634/http://www.strangenotions.com/author/trent-horn/" title="Posts by Trent Horn" rel="author">Trent Horn</a></h4>
        <p>Trent Horn holds a Master\xe2\x80\x99s degree in Theology from the Franciscan University of Steubenville and is currently an apologist and speaker for <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160916225634/http://catholic.com/">Catholic Answers</a>. He specializes in training pro-lifers to intelligently and compassionately engage pro-choice advocates in genuine dialogue. He recently released his first book, titled <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160916225634/http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/1938983432/ref=as_li_ss_tl?ie=UTF8&amp;camp=1789&amp;creative=390957&amp;creativeASIN=1938983432&amp;linkCode=as2&amp;tag=ththve-20"><em>Answering Atheism: How to Make the Case for God with Logic and Charity</em></a>. Follow Trent at his blog, <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160916225634/http://trenthorn.com/"><b>TrentHorn.com</b></a>.</p>
