<li class="email-share"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160423035951/mailto:/?subject=From%20newyorker.com:%20Arguing%20Abortion&amp;body=Arguing%20Abortion%0Ahttp%3A%2F%2Fwww.newyorker.com%2Fnews%2Fdaily-comment%2Farguing-abortion" data-template="mailto:?subject=From%20newyorker.com:%20{{{escaped_text}}}&amp;body={{{escaped_text}}}%0A{{{escaped_url}}}" title="Email" class="email-share-btn"><span></span></a></li>
