<p>&#8211;Yilmaz, O., Sogut, A., Gulle, S., et al. 2008. Sleep quality and depression-anxiety in mothers of chidren with two chronic respiratory diseases: asthma and cystic fibrosis. <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546/http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18585104">http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18585104</a></p>
