	<p>Do people from Ireland go to the UK for late term abortions?</p>
<p>Do they go to other European countries?</p>
<p id="comment-like-95342" data-liked="comment-not-liked" class="comment-likes comment-not-liked"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546/https://abortion.ws/2013/09/04/late-term-abortion-bans-the-pros-and-cons/?like_comment=95342&amp;_wpnonce=6a98752eba" class="comment-like-link needs-login" rel="nofollow" data-blog="2048420"><span>Like</span></a><span id="comment-like-count-95342" class="comment-like-feedback">Like</span></p>
