	<div class="comment-author vcard">
		<img alt="" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546im_/https://0.gravatar.com/avatar/?s=48&amp;d=identicon&amp;r=PG" class="avatar avatar-48" height="48" width="48"/>		<cite class="fn">Todd</cite> <span class="says">Says:</span>	</div>
		<br/>

	<small class="comment-meta commentmetadata"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546/https://abortion.ws/2013/09/04/late-term-abortion-bans-the-pros-and-cons/#comment-95344" title="">
	September 4, 2013 at 8:22 am</a> </small>

	<p>Are there actually people that believe you shouldn&#8217;t be allowed to have an abortion for that defect where the top of the head and brain is gone?</p>
<p id="comment-like-95344" data-liked="comment-not-liked" class="comment-likes comment-not-liked"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546/https://abortion.ws/2013/09/04/late-term-abortion-bans-the-pros-and-cons/?like_comment=95344&amp;_wpnonce=7171eb13eb" class="comment-like-link needs-login" rel="nofollow" data-blog="2048420"><span>Like</span></a><span id="comment-like-count-95344" class="comment-like-feedback">Like</span></p>
<div class="pd-rating" id="pd_rating_holder_1235304_comm_95344"></div>
	<div class="reply">
