<li class="comment odd alt depth-5 parent highlander-comment" id="comment-95909">
	<div id="div-comment-95909">
	<div class="comment-author vcard">
		<img alt="" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546im_/https://0.gravatar.com/avatar/36f87527b3927a8931b393118a45d9dd?s=48&amp;d=identicon&amp;r=PG" class="avatar avatar-48" height="48" width="48"/>		<cite class="fn">Sarah Rose</cite> <span class="says">Says:</span>	</div>
		<br/>

	<small class="comment-meta commentmetadata"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546/https://abortion.ws/2013/09/04/late-term-abortion-bans-the-pros-and-cons/#comment-95909" title="">
	September 10, 2013 at 6:13 pm</a> </small>

	<p>People like me??? what exactly do you by people like me??? I am a pro-choicer and I guess you have never bothered to read my comments or else you would of known that&#8230;what I MEANT was that as a pro-choicer I will not give an inch because I was responding to calmed1&#8217;s comment:  &#8220;Still, it\xe2\x80\x99s worth wondering (even hypothetically) if even the pro-choice side would be willing to give up very late term, wholly elective abortions in exchange for better early access (both proximity-wise and financially) and the full complement of exceptions for late term abortions. Does this strike you as a moderate proposal?&#8221;&#8230;.no I would not give an inch because if you give an inch then they will want a foot&#8230;are we clear now..Responsible?</p>
<p id="comment-like-95909" data-liked="comment-not-liked" class="comment-likes comment-not-liked"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546/https://abortion.ws/2013/09/04/late-term-abortion-bans-the-pros-and-cons/?like_comment=95909&amp;_wpnonce=75d1854730" class="comment-like-link needs-login" rel="nofollow" data-blog="2048420"><span>Like</span></a><span id="comment-like-count-95909" class="comment-like-feedback">Like</span></p>
<div class="pd-rating" id="pd_rating_holder_1235304_comm_95909"></div>
	<div class="reply">
		<a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160909023546/https://abortion.ws/2013/09/04/late-term-abortion-bans-the-pros-and-cons/?replytocom=95909#respond" onclick="return addComment.moveForm( &quot;div-comment-95909&quot;, &quot;95909&quot;, &quot;respond&quot;, &quot;3653&quot; )" aria-label="Reply to Sarah Rose">Reply</a>	</div>
