ttp://www.rawstory.com/2016/09/get-him-baby-oregon-white-supremacist-brutally-kills-black-teen-as-girlfriend-cheers-him-on/"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828im_/http://2d0yaz2jiom3c6vy7e7e5svk.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/russell_courtier_colleen_hunt_mugshot-410x220.jpg" alt=""/><div class="gdl-caption-overlay"></div><div class="flex-caption"><div class="gdl-slider-caption-wrapper"><h2 class="gdl-slider-title">\xe2\x80\x98Get him, baby!\xe2\x80\x99: Oregon white supremacist brutally kills black teen as girlfriend cheers him on</h2></div></div></a></li><li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828/http://www.rawstory.com/2016/09/watch-screaming-white-mom-grabs-black-teen-and-slaps-him-across-the-face-after-school-brawl/"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828im_/http://2d0yaz2jiom3c6vy7e7e5svk.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Heather-Lynn-Sebra-vs-John-Thomas-e1472755964866-410x220.png" alt=""/><div class="gdl-caption-overlay"></div><div class="flex-caption"><div class="gdl-slider-caption-wrapper"><h2 class="gdl-slider-title">WATCH: Screaming white mom grabs black teen and slaps him across the face after school brawl</h2></div></div></a></li><li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828/http://www.rawstory.com/2016/09/nc-cop-impregnated-14-year-old-girl-then-pressured-her-to-have-an-abortion/"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828im_/http://2d0yaz2jiom3c6vy7e7e5svk.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/James-Blair-Gaston-County-Jail-North-Carolina-410x220.jpg" alt=""/><div class="gdl-caption-overlay"></div><div class="flex-caption"><div class="gdl-slider-caption-wrapper"><h2 class="gdl-slider-title">NC cop impregnated 14-year-old girl &#8212; then pressured her to have an abortion</h2></div></div></a></li><li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828/http://www.rawstory.com/2016/09/trump-lashes-out-at-crazy-and-very-dumb-mika-brzezinski-in-latest-twitter-tantrum/"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828im_/http://2d0yaz2jiom3c6vy7e7e5svk.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/mika-and-trump-410x220.jpg" alt=""/><div class="gdl-caption-overlay"></div><div class="flex-caption"><div class="gdl-slider-caption-wrapper"><h2 class="gdl-slider-title">Trump lashes out at &#8216;crazy and very dumb&#8217; Mika Brzezinski in latest Twitter tantrum</h2></div></div></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="clear"></div><div class="page-title-top-shadow"></div></div></div><div class="row gdl-page-row-wrapper"><div class="gdl-page-left mb0 page-left-right-sidebar"><div class="row"><div class="gdl-page-item mb0 pb55 twelve columns"><div class="blog-content-wrapper"><div class="gdl-blog-full"><!-- category: Breaking Banner --><!-- category: Latest Headlines --><!-- category: U.S. News --><div class="blog-tags"></div><div class="clear"></div><h1 class="blog-title">Here are 11 inane and insulting anti-abortion arguments &#8212; and how you can shred the shamers</h1><div class="blog-author"><div class="author_icon_image"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828im_/http://2d0yaz2jiom3c6vy7e7e5svk.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/editors/default.gif" alt="Valerie Tarico, AlterNet"></div><span class="head"></span> <a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828/http://www.rawstory.com/author/tarico/" title="Posts by Valerie Tarico, AlterNet" rel="author">Valerie Tarico, AlterNet</a><br><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828/http://www.rawstory.com/2015/09/21/">21 Sep 2015 at 20:27 ET</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div class="clear"></div><div class="share-container">                        
                        <div class="addthis_responsive_sharing"></div>

                        <script type="text/javascript" src="//web.archive.org/web/20160902223828js_/http://s7.addthis.com/js/300/addthis_widget.js#pubid=roxannecooper"></script>

                        <div class="clear"></div></div><img width="800" height="430" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160902223828im_/http://2d0yaz2jiom3c6vy7e7e5svk.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/teary-bristol-abc-screen-capture-800x430.jpg" class="attachment-800x430 wp-post-image" alt="teary bristol abc screen capture" wibbitz="embed-main-image"/><div class="featured-image-caption"><embristol palin (screen capture)< em></div>                    
                    <div class="follow-appeal-container">
                        <div class="appeal">Don't miss stories. Follow Raw Story!</div>
                        <div class="icons">
