    		The number of couples out there who cannot have a child of their own for physical reasons are too numerous to
    		count. The waiting list for adopting babies can be 5-10 years or more. Young women in their teens are right to be
    		concerned that they're not ready to effectively raise a child. However, if that is the case, there are plenty of
    		wonderful people out there who are.  Not only would you be bringing a valuable life into the world, you'd also be
    		making the dream of a childless couple come true.<br><br>

