<b eza="cwidth:0px;;cheight:0px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:110px;wocalc:110px;hcalc:100px;rend_px_area:0;" cwidth="0" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;font-weight:bold;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/ol[2]/a/li[1]/b[1];pagepos:172;cwidth:110;cheight:0px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:110px;wocalc:110px;hcalc:100;rend_px_area:0;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:3;ez_min_text_wdth:103;req_px_area:11440;obj_px_area:0;req_px_height:20.8;req_margin_and_padding:0;req_ns_height:;vertical_margin:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;">Government gets to control a woman's body.</b>
    		By making abortion illegal, you're introducing a slippery slope that gives government control over a woman's body. You're
    		taking away a personal freedom. Who knows what other controls the government may legislate in the future. Will it have
    		the power to force sterilization? Will it have the power to make motherhood mandatory? Will it next take away the
    		right to use other birth control methods such as The Pill?<br><br>

    		<b eza="cwidth:0px;;cheight:0px;;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:1px;wocalc:1px;hcalc:0px;rend_px_area:0;" cwidth="0" style="background-color:transparent;background-size:auto;font-weight:bold;nodepath:/html/body/div[5]/ol[2]/a/li[1]/b[2];pagepos:174;cwidth:1;cheight:0px;wcalc_source:child;wcalc:1px;wocalc:1px;hcalc:0;rend_px_area:0;minimum_paddings:0px 0px 0px 0px;rcnt:3;ez_min_text_wdth:0;margin-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;padding-for-scale:0px 0px 0px 0px;"></b>
</li>
