    		We all make mistakes in our life, especially when we are young. The pressure to have sex at an early age is fierce
    		in today's society. Even a girl who lives a good, responsible life can have one slip up. But that one slip-up can
    		take away all her life plans and trap her. She may have planned to go to medical school, train for the Olympics,
    		travel the world, or just have fun while she's still young.  All this can be thrown down the drain with one
    		brief mistake. We shouldn't penalize someone for life.<br><br>

