    		Women develop an emotional bond with a child when they carry it through the full term and go through the experience
    		of delivery.  Giving up that child for adoption might be the only reasonable option for a young girl too immature
    		or poor to raise a kid.  However, the women now has to live with a feeling of abandoning their child for the rest
    		of her life. Why do you think so many adoptive parents seek out their kids when they're grown? There's no doubt that
    		some women suffer psychological damage from having an abortion; however, the damage done from giving a child up for
    		adoption is much worse.<br><br>

