    <h2 class="dek">In oral arguments for the Texas abortion case, the three female justices upend the Supreme Court\xe2\x80\x99s balance of power.</h2>

    <div class="byline" id="main_byline">
        By <a rel="author" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20161111035440/http://www.slate.com/authors.dahlia_lithwick.html">Dahlia Lithwick</a>
    </div>












