 <div class=" none">
        <figure class="image inline " style="width: 590px;  display: block;margin: 0 auto;float: none;"> <img src_tag_name="src" title="160302_SCOTUS_Female-SCOTUS" alt="84380140" src="/web/20161111035440im_/http://www.slate.com/content/dam/slate/articles/news_and_politics/supreme_court_dispatches/2016/03/160302_SCOTUS_Female-SCOTUS.jpg.CROP.promo-xlarge2.jpg"> <figcaption class="caption"><span>Supreme Court Justices Elena Kagan, Sonia Sotomayor, and Ruth Bader Ginsburg.</span></figcaption>  <p class="credit">Allison Shelley/Getty Images</p> 
