                                        <h3 class="kicker">
                                            <span class="kicker-label"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20161007020254/http://www.nytimes.com/pages/world/europe/index.html">Europe</a></span>                                                                                                                                            </h3>
                        			<h1 itemprop="headline" id="headline" class="headline">Protesters in Poland Rally Against Proposal for Total Abortion Ban</h1>
	                                                <div id="story-meta-footer" class="story-meta-footer">


<p class="byline-dateline"><span class="byline" itemprop="author creator" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">By <span class="byline-author" data-byline-name="JOANNA BERENDT" itemprop="name" data-twitter-handle="JoannaBerendt">JOANNA BERENDT</span></span><time class="dateline" datetime="2016-10-04T18:32:20-04:00" itemprop="dateModified" content="2016-10-04T18:32:20-04:00">OCT. 3, 2016</time>
</p>

                                    <div class="story-meta-footer-sharetools">
                        <div id="sharetools-story-meta-footer" aria-label="tools" role="group" class="sharetools theme-classic  sharetools-story-meta-footer  " data-shares="facebook,twitter,email,show-all,save" data-url="http://web.archive.org/web/20161007020254oe_/http://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/04/world/europe/poland-abortion-black-monday.html" data-title="Protesters in Poland Rally Against Proposal for Total Abortion Ban" data-author="By JOANNA BERENDT" data-media="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2016/10/04/world/video-poland/video-poland-jumbo.jpg" data-description="As many as 24,000 Poles, dressed in black, took to the streets in Warsaw to protest the proposed legislation. \xe2\x80\x9cLet them have their fun,\xe2\x80\x9d the foreign minister said." data-publish-date="October 3, 2016">
<a class="visually-hidden skip-to-text-link" href="#story-continues-1">Continue reading the main story</a>
<span class="sharetools-label visually-hidden">Share This Page</span>
<div class="ad sharetools-inline-article-ad hidden nocontent robots-nocontent">
<a class="visually-hidden skip-to-text-link" href="#story-continues-1">Continue reading the main story</a>
</div>
</div><!-- close shareTools -->
                                                                                                </div>
