        <h1 class="article-title">Supreme Court Abortion Arguments Show Why Elections Matter</h1>         <h2 class="article-sub-title">Justices appointed by Democrats were on fire Wednesday, showing the nonsense behind Texas&#039; abortion law</h2>
        <div class="article-contributor">
                            <div class="author-block">
                                    </div>
                <span class="author">By <a href="/web/20160424203230/http://www.rollingstone.com/contributor/david-cohen" rel="author" data-track data-track-action="Tap Byline" data-track-label="/contributor/david-cohen">David S. Cohen</a></span>
                        <time>March 2, 2016</time>
                    </div>

<div class="social-icons-container">
