	<div class="columns two-col">
		<div class="primary">
			    <div class="has-bulleted-list article-container">
        	        <figure class="article-img-holder ">
                                <img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160424203230im_/http://assets.rollingstone.com/assets/2016/article/supreme-court-abortion-arguments-show-why-elections-matter-20160302/230633/medium_rect/1456952020/720x405-GettyImages-89039589.jpg" alt="Sonia Sotomayor" class=""/>

                        <figcaption>
                                    Justice Sonia Sotomayor wanted to know Wednesday why Texas doesn&#039;t go after colonoscopies, which are 28 times riskier than abortion.
                                                    <span class="credit">Win McNamee/Getty</span>
                            </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div>

<div class="social-stick social-icons-container">
    <ul class="social-bar vertical" data-track-action="Social Left">
        <li class="facebook">
            <a class="rs-icon-facebook" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160424203230/http://rol.st/1QMcQJa" data-track data-track-label="Share - Facebook" data-href="http://rol.st/1QMcQJa">
                <span>Share</span>
