                        <div class="col-sm-12">
                            <h2 class="post_title" style="margin-left:15px;margin-right:15px">Bodily Rights Arguments for Abortion are Always Extremist Arguments With No Compromise</h2>
                            <div class="meta" style="margin-left:15px;margin-right:15px">
                                <i class="fa fa-comment" style="font-size:15px"></i>
                                <span class="categoryname"><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160507122331/http://www.lifenews.com/category/editorials/">Opinion</a></span> &nbsp; <div style="clear:both" class="show-xs hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg"></div>Timothy Brahm &nbsp; May 6, 2016 &nbsp; | &nbsp; 1:17PM &nbsp;&nbsp; Washington, DC                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-8 col-lg-8">
                            <div class="col-sm-12">

                                <img class="img-responsive hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160507122331im_/http://lifenews.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/protest20b.jpg" style="min-width:100%;padding-bottom:30px;">                                                                    <div class="post-featured-image hidden-xs" style="background-image:url(http://web.archive.org/web/20160507122331im_/http://lifenews.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/protest20b.jpg)"></div>
                                                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-2 hidden-sm hidden-xs" style="text-align:center;">


<script type="text/javascript" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160507122331js_/http://s7.addthis.com/js/250/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-561eb1f6419ee1dc"></script>
