	<span class="title" style="margin:0px; padding:0px; text-align:left;"><h2 style="margin:0px; padding:0px; text-align:left;"><span style="font-size:36px; color:#333;">Should Parental Consent Be Required for Pregnant Minors to Have Abortions?</span></h2></span>
